This software is a derivative work. It is a port of DBOS Transact for Go
(https://github.com/dbos-inc/dbos-transact-golang) to Elixir.

The database schema, the status and step-name protocol constants, the SQL, and
the algorithms for workflow checkpointing, replay, recovery, queue dequeueing,
messaging, and transactional steps are all derived from that project. Portions
of this software are therefore covered by the following notice, which is
reproduced in full as the MIT License requires.

